Why This Market Matters
E-beam accelerators provide controlled electron irradiation for applications ranging from sterilization and food treatment to polymer processing, semiconductor-related processes, and scientific research. Their ability to deliver rapid treatment without radioactive source material is supporting adoption across multiple industries. However, accelerator projects can involve significant capital expenditure, shielding requirements, dosimetry systems, conveyor infrastructure, and regulatory validation.

